OL,3,GNEWSAGreen councillor quits over
OL,4,AZionism row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Green councillor in Sefton has
OL,7,Fresigned from the party after members
OL,8,Fpassed a motion describing Zionism as a
OL,9,Fform of racism at the party's
OL,10,Fconference in Brighton.
OL,12,FKieran Dams, 23, who has represented
OL,13,Fthe Waterloo ward since May, will now
OL,14,Fsit as an independent.
OL,16,FHe said: "I think the party is heading
OL,17,Finto a dark place".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
