OL,3,GNEWSAGreen councillor quits over
OL,4,AZionism row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green party's leader Zack Polanski
OL,7,Fhas said he will not accept anyone
OL,8,Fbeing excluded from the Green Party
OL,9,F"because of the religious or communal
OL,10,Fbody they are part of".
